Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 15:43:48 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] feat(opensovd-gateway): serve HVAC diag_api resources
 instead of demo data

Eclipse SDV Hackathon Chapter 4 - 2026

Replace the Constant demo providers with an example HVAC application whose
cabin_temp, sensor_fault_status and sensor_stuck resources are served through
the sovd_adapter. A time-based debounce (Debounce::TimeBased semantics) turns
an injected stuck sensor into a qualified fault. Integration tests drive the
running gateway through opensovd-client.

Refs #16

